cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this index or its numbers, please cite it as below."
title: "uploader.jp / getuploader.com archive index (community index + supplement)"
abstract: >-
  An index of spaces on the Japanese file host uploader.jp / getuploader.com, which shuts down on
  2026-11-25. It combines the community crawl (239,152 spaces) with 1,630 spaces that crawl misses,
  records per-space file counts and sizes from each space's 統計 block, and marks which spaces have
  been archived (506 spaces / 26,922 files / 83.2 GB) — including a page-level WARC archive of the
  sample space (9,748 URLs).
type: dataset
version: "2026-10-27"
date-released: "2026-10-27"
license: MIT
identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: "https://uploaderjp-archive.surge.sh/meta.json"
    description: "Upstream community index used as the base list (not relicensed here)"
keywords:
  - web archiving
  - uploader.jp
  - getuploader
  - file host
  - WARC
  - dataset catalogue
